{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_1","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/zsh -lc 'cat solver_index.md'","aggregated_output":"# Generated solver source index\n\nUse line ranges to inspect only definitions relevant to the current level.\n\n## players.py\n- L5--6 `def play_level_1(env):`; calls: solve_peg_jumps\n- L9--10 `def play_level_2(env):`; calls: solve_peg_ferry\n- L13--30 `def play_level_3(env):`; calls: move_socket_team, solve_peg_jumps\n- L33--36 `def play_level_4(env): # Recovered from verified proposer path artifact: checkpoint.json+/Users/sasha/gkm/output/arc_agi3_gpt61_zero_seed_20261116T144404Z/source/arc/crack_lab/runs/scratch/gkm_legs_ws_lf52_arc_agi3_n0_fresh_frontier_fty5uh_`\n- L39--83 `def play_level_5(env):`; calls: jump_supported_route, move_socket_team\n\n## legs.py\n- L7--69 `def solve_peg_jumps(env, *, extra_sockets=(), target_pegs=None):` — Read square sockets, plan orthogonal peg captures, verify, then execute.; calls: RuntimeError, abs, connected_components, enumerate, frozenset, len, lru_cache, min, observe, plan, +2\n- L72--150 `def solve_peg_ferry(env):` — Stage captures onto a movable socket, ferry it, and capture off it.; calls: RuntimeError, abs, any, carrier, connected_components, deque, len, list, max, min, +6\n- L153--169 `def move_socket_team(env, actions, *, expected_centers):` — Follow a tested shared-key route, checking visible socket endpoints on a clone.; calls: RuntimeError, centers, connected_components, safe_step, sleep, sorted\n- L172--214 `def jump_supported_route(env, jumps, *, expected_pegs=None):` — Verify and replay jumps over consumable pegs or persistent pink supports.; calls: RuntimeError, abs, connected_components, objects, safe_step, set, sleep, sorted\n\n## perception.py\n- L23--36 `class Blob:`; calls: dataclass\n- L39--40 `def arr(frame) -> np.ndarray:`\n- L43--45 `def color_counts(frame) -> Dict[int, int]:`; calls: arr, int, zip\n- L48--79 `def connected_components(frame, colors: Optional[It